{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>深水埗福華街50號一間美容美髮店被人淋油。今早（25日）9時許55分，警方接獲上址職員報案。警員到場發現美容美髮店的玻璃門和牆身沾滿黑色漆油，案件仍在調查中，警方將案件列作刑事毁壞。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.825403+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:34:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:35.917121+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:18.336704+00:00","content_hash":"ee287c7d8ee739a902880b8abbfc43a1b18a7d5914c94a43aa04341946513532","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T04:23:52.825403+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}